      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i got a bit of a fever and a headache today. i've been dealing with hepatitis c for a few years now so i'm always a bit careful but i really need something to take the pain down. how many grams of tylenol can i safely take at once to get this to go away? i take it pretty often so i just want to make sure i don't overdo it",
